  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scaling marine life regeneration together with marine infrastructure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reefy is a Delft-based start-up that has developed an artificial reef structure that is both stable enough to handle strong waves while also serving as a habitat for fish and other sealife. The combination of these two functions makes it an innovative and very unique product. The modular system consists of mega-sized building blocks that can be assembled underwater to create a stable submerged breakwater to protect the coast while being the foundation of a new reef. The product has been tested and proven against daily and hurricane conditions at the renowned wave facilities of Deltares in Delft.</narrative>
  </description>
